{
  "id": "poem-eeb20fdd637709436a202b26",
  "title": "如梦令·昨夜雨疏风骤",
  "author": "李清照",
  "dynasty": "宋",
  "verses": [
    "昨夜雨疏风骤。",
    "浓睡不消残酒。",
    "试问卷帘人，却道海棠依旧。",
    "知否。",
    "知否。",
    "应是绿肥红瘦。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "宋词选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/宋词/ci.song.6000.json#record-685",
